'''Inspirational''' is a notable [[Ascendancy passive skill]] for the [[Champion]] that grants increased [[aura]] effect. It also causes [[Banner]] skills to recover a portion of the [[Valour]] used when it was placed, and grants life [[regeneration]] the scales with the amount of Valour used.

The effects of the aura does not stack with another instance of Inspirational from another nearby party member.<ref name=MarkGGG/>

Valour is ''gained'' when you leave your Banner's Area and the amount can be scaled by [[Banner Valour Gained]] small passive nodes and [[Perfidy]].

==Ruthless mode==
{{infocard
|header    = Inspirational (Ruthless)
|subheader = Ascendancy Notable Passive Skill
|1         = <div class="passive-icon-container passive-icon-type__ascendancy_notable"><div class="passive-icon-frame"></div>[[File:Inpirational (Champion) passive skill icon.png]]</div>
|2         = Having a placed Banner does not prevent you gaining Valour
}}

Inspirational in [[Ruthless mode]] does not grant any of its original effect. It instead enables you to gain Valour even while a Banner has been placed.

==Version history==
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.25.0|
* The Inspirational Ascendancy Passive Skill no longer provides "Banner Skills have no Reservation". It now grants "When you leave your Banner's Area, recover 30% of the Valour consumed for that Banner" instead of "When you create a Banner, it gains 40% of the Stages of your placed Banner".
* {{Ruthless}} The Champion's Inspirational Ascendancy Passive Skill no longer has any of its old properties. It now has "Having a placed Banner does not prevent you gaining Valour".
}}
{{Version history table row|3.22.0|
* No longer provides "30% increased effect of Non-Curse Auras from your Skills" or "You and Allies affected by your placed Banners Regenerate 0.1% of Life per second for each Stage" in Ruthless.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.14.2|
* Fixed a bug with life regeneration on the "Inspirational" [[Champion]] Ascendancy passive skill not working.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.13.0|
* Now grants 30% increased effect of non-curse auras (from 15%)
* Removed {{c|mod|You and nearby Allies have 12% increased Movement Speed}}
}}
{{Version history table row|3.7.0|
* Now causes banners you create to gain 40% of the stages of your placed banner (from 20%). You and allies affected by your placed banners now regenerate 0.1% of maximum life per second for each stage (from 0.5%).
}}
{{Version history table row|3.2.0|
* Inspirational now also causes your Banner skills to reserve no mana, recover 20% of planted Banner Stages when you cast a banner while you have a banner planted, and causes you and nearby allies to recover 0.5% of maximum life per Banner stage when you plant a banner. It also grants 15% increased effect of Non-Curse Auras from your Skills.
* No longer grants 30% increased damage to allies.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.2.0|
* Movement speed bonus increased from 8% to 12%.
}}
{{Version history table row|2.3.0|
* Increased Movement Speed decreased from 10% to 8%.
}}
{{Version history table row|2.2.0|
* Added to the game.
}}
{{Version history table end}}

